      "title": "Second quarter dividend of ₹2.37 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹2.37. Ex-date: 5th February 2026 Payment date: 12th February 2026 Dividend yield will be 5.5%, which is about the same as the industry average.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
