      "date": "2026-02-01T17:24:00.000Z",
      "title": "Now 23% overvalued",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 2.3% to ₹159. The fair value is estimated to be ₹130, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 10% over the last year. Meanwhile, the company has become profitable. Revenue is forecast to grow by 15% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 65% in the next 2 years.",
